  "metadata": {
    "title": "《點石齋畫報》西醫院照護二則",
    "roman_title": "Dian shi zhai hua bao: Yi ju cheng zai and Xi yi zhi bing",
    "author": "《點石齋畫報》編刊者（報導未見可確讀的正文署名）",
    "date": "光緒十二年（1886），庚十及庚十一；原圖未載月日",
    "location": "München",
    "repository": "巴伐利亞邦立圖書館（Bayerische Staatsbibliothek）",
    "collection": "點石齋畫報，第 1 函",
    "shelfmark": "L.sin. K 175-1/10",
    "catalogue": "https://opacplus.bsb-muenchen.de/title/BV040390393",
    "language": "lzh",
    "description": "《點石齋畫報》庚集刊於 1886 年。〈醫局成災〉記述福州南臺中洲濟世醫院失火時，院方從病房撤出男女老幼。〈西醫治病〉描繪題作「都中施醫院」的診間與候診人群，報導西醫問診時由一名西方女性協助傳譯。兩則可用於晚清醫療史、就醫圖像與醫病溝通研究。",
    "description_en": "Two reports in the 1886 Dianshizhai Pictorial depict hospital care in the late Qing. Yi ju cheng zai describes the evacuation of patients from Jishi Hospital in Nantai, Fuzhou, during a fire. Xi yi zhi bing depicts a waiting room and a Western woman interpreting for a physician at the Shi yi yuan, described in the report as being in the capital. The reports document how the illustrated press depicted hospital care, patient access and communication across languages.",
    "txt_reader_statement": "每篇題名、刊號、圖中字樣、畫款與印記分列。各面正文由右至左。文末附可連讀文字。□ 表示未定字。",
    "tei_editorial_statement": "逐幅依序錄入兩篇完整圖說，用面、欄及影像區域保存篇題、圖中文字、畫款和印記的來源位置。連讀文本依原欄序串接，未添加標點。",
